	=> END
- "Arvek's mark and the forge tally agree." [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS) and not GameState.get_flag("dom_dishonest_casks_traced") /]
	do GameState.set_flag("dom_dishonest_casks_traced", true)
	Keth Varr: Then choose the danger Dom carries: a brief silence now or guarded water beneath every hammer.
	=> END
- "Seal the suspect casks until clean water arrives." [#consequence=Council safety before an uninterrupted Hammer Roar] [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS) and QuestRegistry.flags_met(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS) /]
	do QuestRegistry.resolve_side_quest(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS, "halt-the-water")
	Keth Varr: The seals stay shut. Let every shortened shift remember why.
	=> END
- "Keep the forges sounding under a guarded water rotation." [#consequence=Concord watch keeps the Hammer Roar alive] [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS) and QuestRegistry.flags_met(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS) /]
	do QuestRegistry.resolve_side_quest(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS, "keep-the-roar")
	Keth Varr: Every cask gets a watcher and every watcher signs twice. The Roar holds.
	=> END
- "What changed after the casks were sealed?" [if QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS) and GameState.get_flag("dom_dishonest_casks_resolution") == "halt-the-water" /]
	Keth Varr: The suspect casks remain under Council seal; the East Arm works shorter shifts on clean reserves.
	=> END
- "What changed after the guarded rotation?" [if QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.DISHONEST_CASKS) and GameState.get_flag("dom_dishonest_casks_resolution") == "keep-the-roar" /]
	Keth Varr: Every cooling cask now carries a Concord watcher; the Hammer Roar never stopped.
	=> END
- "Leave the seals with you."
	Keth Varr: I trust metal more than promises. Today I have both.
	=> END

